{"content": "```bash\nfind /var -type f -size +100M -exec ls -lh {} \\;\n```\n\n### Explanation of Flags\n\n*   **`find`**: The command-line utility used to search for files.\n*   **`/var`**: The starting directory for the search. The command will recursively traverse all subdirectories under `/var`.\n*   **`-type f`**: Restricts the search to **files** only (ignoring directories, symbolic links, etc.).\n*   **`-size +100M`**: Filters results to find files **larger than** 100 Megabytes.\n    *   `+` means \"greater than\".\n    *   `M` specifies the unit as Megabytes.\n*   **`-exec ... \\;`**: Executes the following command (`ls -lh`) for each file found.\n    *   `{}` is a placeholder for the current file path.\n    *   `\\;` terminates the command passed to `-exec`.\n*   **`ls -lh {}`** (executed internally):\n    *   `-l`: Uses long listing format (shows permissions, owner, size, date).", "reasoning": null, "logprobs": [{"token": "```", "logprob": -2.633413591252161, "top_logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.5656779192550907}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -1.1620219133957157}, {"token": "```", "logprob": -2.633413591252161}, {"token": "You", "logprob": -3.2588980578048954}, {"token": "The", "logprob": -5.4785826586349735}, {"token": "`", "logprob": -6.280592241154505}, {"token": "###", "logprob": -6.321777620182825}, {"token": "Use", "logprob": -8.646456041203333}, {"token": "There", "logprob": -8.712400712834192}, {"token": "bash", "logprob": -8.94923619257052}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -9.022405900822474}, {"token": "B", "logprob": -9.508741655217005}, {"token": "Command", "logprob": -10.278692521916224}, {"token": "Run", "logprob": -10.365501680241419}, {"token": "#", "logprob": -10.822256364689661}, {"token": "No", "logprob": -10.956542291508509}, {"token": "to", "logprob": -10.992812433110071}, {"token": "One", "logprob": -11.000838556156946}, {"token": "`,", "logprob": -11.122685708866907}, {"token": "First", "logprob": -11.163145341740442}]}, {"toke